    {
      "section": "论日上起时例",
      "text": "论日上起时例",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c019:p0002",
      "sha256": "8e292191dc59056710894fba63909f7db5391a65eb4391bbb58fcec5a0e2ae69"
    },
    {
      "section": "论日上起时例",
      "text": "甲己还加甲，乙庚丙作初，丙辛从戊起，丁壬庚子居，戊癸何方发？壬子是真途。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c019:p0003",
      "sha256": "c363373452fc1c0546945e31f7999cd1662e1056c2a1aa854de227543d4d2138"
    },
    {
      "section": "论日上起时例",
      "text": "其法以甲己日从时上起甲子，至本人生时。余皆仿此。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c019:p0004",
      "sha256": "e0e93897c63a76fb6313c7ac18dcddbe1e3feafed57f43236267c8943c258934"
    },
    {
      "section": "论日上起时例",
      "text": "眉批：以甲子日生日子起，如甲子日午时於子上起甲子，丑上起乙丑，寅上起丙寅，余仿此。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
